# The Thinkpad's slackware64-current, pinned 2026-11-22 (BackShot1).
# Every later install and restore test of the -current Thinkpad uses this
# one tree, not whatever -current has become.  Made by slackware-pin.sh,
# kept read-only on the backup drive (mybig512) at
# slackware-cache/current-20261121, with its PINNED.txt; installed by
#   slackware-bootstrap.sh SERIAL KEYS_DIR thinkpad CACHE_DIR current-20261121
# which holds CHECKSUMS.md5 to the SHA-256 below (its PINS table; also
# slackware-pin.sh's PINS and bs1-adopt's slk_pin_sha), and makes the pin
# itself slackpkg's mirror on the installed system
# (file:///mnt/bs1-backup/slackware-cache/current-20261121/), never live
# -current.  Checked again, offline:
#   slackware-pin.sh CACHE_DIR --check current-20261121

